sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant VS as VS Code Copilot
    participant MCP as MCP App
    participant BE as Java Backend
    participant GH as GitHub API
    
    Dev->>VS: "sync my issues"
    VS->>MCP: sync_issues(repo)
    MCP->>GH: Fetch issues (gh CLI)
    GH-->>MCP: Issues JSON
    MCP->>BE: POST /api/issues/sync
    BE-->>MCP: Cached ✓
    
    Dev->>VS: "show my burnout wheel"
    VS->>MCP: show_burnout_wheel(repo)
    MCP->>BE: GET /api/stress
    BE->>BE: Classify → Metrics → WorldState
    BE-->>MCP: Stress score + 3-3-3 plan
    MCP-->>VS: Interactive flamegraph panel
